    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like that, the dog hopped onto a train and set off on a journey no one knew\u2014a secret it couldn\u2019t share. Along the long trip, it dreamt dream after dream\u2014strange, surprising, and filled with mysteries. Will it reach its heart\u2019s destination, or get lost in its dreams? The answer is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t Wake Up My Dream</i> is a lighthearted puzzle-adventure. You\u2019ll dive into the dog\u2019s dreamscape, where each inner drama pops in a different style. From sweet love interludes to absurd daily moments, each dream is a standalone story full of puzzles waiting to be discovered and solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free exploration drives the story</strong>: Uncover quirky events that make you smile\u2014and gently steer the dream\u2019s direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky events &amp; multiple endings</strong>: Your choices shape each ending\u2014from healing warmth to unexpected turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed, varied gameplay</strong>: Light puzzles, interactive triggers, mini-games, and narrative choices\u2014fun and easygoing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn art &amp; original music</strong>: Gets you into a cozy, magical dream world packed with emotion and laughs.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/637ed2eb3a1e7f843998f129b5c3cb80.poster.avif?t=1754997326\" width=800 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/637ed2eb3a1e7f843998f129b5c3cb80.webm?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/637ed2eb3a1e7f843998f129b5c3cb80.mp4?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/f6c415edc6a123bb8b6d141f788bd409.poster.avif?t=1754997326\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/f6c415edc6a123bb8b6d141f788bd409.webm?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/f6c415edc6a123bb8b6d141f788bd409.mp4?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/a7259021b48b7a8ed809a600cd0b790d.poster.avif?t=1754997326\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/a7259021b48b7a8ed809a600cd0b790d.webm?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/a7259021b48b7a8ed809a600cd0b790d.mp4?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/a0336ff63f3bd46621447263df46ac81.poster.avif?t=1754997326\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/a0336ff63f3bd46621447263df46ac81.webm?t=1754997326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/a0336ff63f3bd46621447263df46ac81.mp4?t=1754997326\" ty